		{
			dependencies: ["51B4F0043EFD8726"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"&4The Hanged Man Pathway&r delves mainly into relics, crafting and collecting them. To do thus, a substantial amount of monster hunting is required."
				""
				"During my time in the City of Sparkon, I met a reliquerer of this Pathway, who had evolved from an archmage, as a couple of mages do."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"His name is &cSantiago&r. He left me a couple of notes, and I've also written down a couple of our dialogues. Although he's a native to Sparkon, he spent more time outside of the city out on monster hunting raids to collect the rarest of ingredients. While he is officially an archmage as well as a reliquerer, he really did the bare minimum to be able to pass as an archmage."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"It is adjacent to &6The Sun Pathway&r, &fThe Star Pathway&r and &4The Moon Pathway&r."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_dependency_lines: true
