		{
			dependencies: ["4E4E81226BED0E7C"]
			description: [
				"The Angelheart Vial is a reliquerer's main trick: cheating death a countless number of times. Or at least per the number of vials they have stacked in their pockets."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Legends say an archmage once defied a god by using this vial. For lightning and divine kill could not bring him down, or at least to death, he was thrown into the void, his corpse never to be found."
			]
