		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7D281BDB1C2472F1"]
			description: [
				"With the power of the Tome of Alkahestry, I managed to borrow some of the properties of transmutation to create a version of the famed Glacial Staff that doesn't require snowballs. It does require more materials to make than normal, though."
				""
				"&cSebastian&r was bewildered at my progress, clutching his own staff and praising it as a bastion of tradition against this strange new magic."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The Glacial Staff is an interesting weapon, able to fire surprisingly strong mystical snowballs of the ice element, especially effective against fire-type creatures such as blazes. It also freezes enemies momentarily."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "641652D8289A2AF2"
			rewards: [{
				id: "09A4993D7B812057"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "7F2EF4CFDB194DD8"
				item: "reliquary:glacial_staff"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 4.0500000000000025d
			y: 14.2d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7D281BDB1C2472F1"]
			description: [
				"I've found notes of a way older fireball staff used by an ancient civilization. I was able to find the core and a mangled stick, but alas, it did not work anymore. It seems to ressemble the Pyromancer staffs in a more crude form."
				""
				"With my usual tinkering, I made a version of the fireball staff that does not consume fire charges, and here's the recipe above."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "728B9DCC6EEF04E2"
