			x: 7.0500000000000025d
			y: 12.7d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7D281BDB1C2472F1"]
			description: [
				"&c\"I use this one on a daily basis, so you could probably tell that I'm particularly fond of this relic. The Rending Gale has three modes of function: flight, push, and pull. When in flight mode, the staff will (rather violently) pull you in the direction you're looking at extreme speeds! Incredible for getting anywhere fast, but it can be a bit dizzying the first forty or so uses. When in push mode, it expels a strong gust around you, preventing anything from getting anywhere close! Very good for taking a breather. When in pull mode, it creates a vortex of wind that sucks in everything in a chosen direction towards you. With all of these incredible use cases, I'm honestly more surprised it isn't more popular!\""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"\"Isn't it rather expensive to gather the materials to make it? Obviously it wouldn't be a common commodity if the average person couldn't get it.\""
				""
				"&c\"Yeah, but I never see any of my fellow magic users have one either! It's weird. I'd make a business around them if I wasn't so busy adventuring all the time.\"&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "439A7FD241E5D5E4"
			rewards: [{
				id: "63645AD02ADD8D07"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "21D8996224D0CFE4"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					ForgeCaps: {
						Parent: {
							Items: [{
								amount: 0
								filter: {
									Count: 1b
									id: "minecraft:feather"
								}
							}]
