				item: {
					Count: 1
					ForgeCaps: {
						Parent: {
							Items: [ ]
						}
					}
					id: "reliquary:void_tear"
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 1.6500000000000001d
			y: 9.299999999999997d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0901394AD3A5FDAB"]
			description: [
				"Magicbane is a relic with immense potential: it increases its power with each enchantment. It, however, has very low durability. Fortunately, by combining this with the Magician card, it becomes unbreakable, an all-around upgrade to the giant golden sword even some mages still use up to this point."
				""
				"It also has a higher chance of obtaining rare and exotic materials from monsters."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "21E6CA24E283AF68"
			rewards: [
