		{
			dependencies: ["21E6CA24E283AF68"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_started"
			description: [
				"Out of all of the weapons I've come across on my travels, up until now, this probably makes the top five. It uses Kestrel as a base, harvests the power of Magicbane using a transformative flower, and when swung, shoots deadly beams with the power of the Rending Gale, summoning lightning strikes on hit."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"I can proudly say I've been the one to create this relic. I invented a relic! The first of a kind the world has never seen before!"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "50F5D21769C1B356"
			rewards: [{
				id: "42361E30C508BC7E"
