			x: -0.2000000000000013d
			y: 14.674999999999997d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["081070F7CBF61207"]
			description: [
				"&c\"If you ever thought that ender pearls offered a distinct lack of options in forms of teleportation, this one might be a favourable pick for you. Instead of relying on strength of arm to dictate where you end up, the Ender Staff has three distinct modes that allow for more controlled self-teleportation. It has a basic mode which launches an ender pearl as normal, but it also has a long range mode that discharges the projectile with significantly less regard for gravity, allowing for significantly further instant transportation. \"&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&c\"Additionally, it features a waypoint mode, which instantly sends you to the last Wraith Node you interacted with. Overall a very solid relic.\"&r"
				""
				"I've innovated a bit on the concept and, on my first attempt, managed to somehow create a version of this staff that doesn't consume ender pearls! I noted down the recipe above. Sebastian was dumbfounded."
			]
