			}]
			x: 3.650000000000004d
			y: 8.799999999999997d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4128B0BDF74E7913"]
			description: [
				"&c\"While I was still in training here in the city of Sparkon, I was actually learning the practices of the apothecary. While it didn't end up being the path I had stuck with, I still implement it in my routine since the methods are a little too valuable to just forget about. Instead of haphazardly stuffing ingredients one after another like many other brewers, apothecaries first grind a mix of components into a potion essence. \""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&c\"Each ingredient can correspond to multiple different effects, but they require at least one shared effect in order to be concentrated into the essence. Then, we put the essence into the cauldron, add any universal reagents as desired, then throw in a bit of Nether Wart. This nets us three potions of significantly increased potency compared to their contemporaries!\"&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "30753449F4BD9E2A"
			rewards: [{
				id: "6DE2D735DFB6B7C1"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
