			description: [
				"&o&7 The handwriting brusquely changes"
				""
				"&6&fEleonore's&6 notes abruptly end here. That's odd. I would have thought she'd have reached The Devil. From the legends I've heard, she had acquired the Philosopher's Stone, but it isn't documented in this journal. It seems that &fEleonore &6took particular attention in the Salamander's Eye, but never properly documented it aside from a crude drawing of the eye."
				""
				"&6I was able to create one for myself, albeit most likely at a much higher cost than what traditional reliquerers could muster. The artefact does not seem particularly useful on the surface but may have hidden power."
			]
